  m_Name: Evento_DelegacaoInternacionalVisitaACidade
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: "Delega\xE7\xE3o Internacional Visita a Cidade"
  _titleEn: International Delegation Visits the City
  _category: 1
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Visitas de outros governos trocam experi\xEAncias e podem render parcerias
    e investimentos."
  _summaryEn: Visits from other governments exchange experience and can lead to partnerships
    and investment.
  _realWorld: "O BRT, que Curitiba montou completo em 1974, se espalhou pelo mundo;
    o TransMilenio, aberto em Bogot\xE1 em 2000, levou o modelo a uma metr\xF3pole
    de milh\xF5es de passageiros."
  _realWorldEn: "BRT, which Curitiba fully built in 1974, spread around the world;
    TransMilenio, opened in Bogot\xE1 in 2000, brought the model to a metropolis
    of millions of riders."
  _tradeOffs: "Receber bem d\xE1 visibilidade, mas o que conta \xE9 o que a cidade
    entrega no dia a dia."
  _tradeOffsEn: Hosting well brings visibility, but what counts is what the city
    delivers every day.
  _sources:
  - Label: Bus rapid transit (Wikipedia)
    Url: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bus_rapid_transit
  - Label: TransMilenio (Wikipedia)
    Url: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/TransMilenio
